// @check
// @error '__memory_shared__' is internal to std
// `__memory_shared__()` is std-internal (DECISIONS.md "std:buffer's allocator over a shared
// memory"): a call from outside std is refused at every position, regardless of
// `--shared-memory` — the refusal is about WHERE the call is written, not what the build
// decides.
print(__memory_shared__())
if __memory_shared__() { print(100) }
function pick() {
  if __memory_shared__() { return 100 }
  1
}
print(pick())
